$ZZTMMO Public Beta
- - - - -

   Found a problem?  Please tell us:

  github.com/shotintoeternity/zztmmo/issues

   Say which world you were in, what you
did, and what happened.

$Good to know

   *  ZZTMMO is built for a desktop
      browser and a keyboard.  Phones
      and tablets can play with the
      on-screen buttons, but they get
      less testing.

   *  Worlds run live on the server, so
      a restart returns everyone to the
      title screen.  Save with [S] and
      come back with [R].

   *  "Dream a world" asks a language
      model for a new world and is rate
      limited.  If it refuses, wait a
      minute and try again.
